NavOnlineOssRules = OSS line: non-Hungarian VAT rate or a VAT code with a country suffix (e.g. USt-AT). Period: date of supply (else invoice date). Conversion: ECB rate of the last day of the quarter (or the next publication day); EUR invoices are not converted. A credit note correcting an invoice of an earlier quarter goes to the corrections part at the rate of the original period. Drafts and "replaced" invoices are excluded.

