NavOnlineErrFadAamBuyer = the customer is subject-exempt (VAT code 1 in its tax number) and cannot be invoiced with reverse charge (Hungarian VAT Act 142. § (3)).
NavOnlineErrFadAamSeller = A subject-exempt seller (VAT code 1 in the company tax number) cannot issue a reverse charge (FAD) document (Hungarian VAT Act 142. § (3)).
NavOnlineErrKb = An intra-Community exempt line (KBAET, KBAUK) may only be invoiced to a company registered in another EU member state, with a community VAT number of that state – "%s":
NavOnlineErrKbHu = the customer is in Hungary.
NavOnlineErrKbNotEu = the customer's country (%s) is not an EU member state; use the export code (EAM).
NavOnlineErrKbPrivate = the customer is a private person.
NavOnlineErrKbNoVat = the customer card has no community VAT number (VAT ID field).
NavOnlineErrKbVatFormat = the customer's community VAT number ("%s") has an invalid format; enter it with the country prefix, e.g. DE123456789.
NavOnlineErrKbVatCountry = the prefix of the community VAT number (%s) is not the customer's country (%s); the address and the VAT number must match.
NavOnlineErrKbVies = according to the EU VIES system the community VAT number (%s) is not valid. Ask the customer for a valid number or invoice with VAT.
NavOnlineErrKbViesDown = the EU VIES system is not available now (%s) and this VAT number has no successful check in the last %s days. Try again later.
NavOnlineWarnViesDown = The EU VIES system is not available now (%s). Validated on the basis of the earlier successful VIES check of %s (%s).
NavOnlineErrEam = An export (EAM) line is only allowed when the goods leave the European Union:
NavOnlineErrEamHu = the goods go to Hungary (%s). Use VAT or another domestic code for a domestic supply.
NavOnlineErrEamEu = the goods go to an EU member state (%s, %s). Use an intra-Community (KBAET) or a VAT supply.
NavOnlineErrEamNi = the customer is in Northern Ireland (XI VAT number); goods sent there get intra-Community treatment (KBAET).
NavOnlineEamDestShipping = delivery address of the document
NavOnlineEamDestCustomer = customer address, the document has no delivery address
NavOnlineErrZeroService = The %s code is for goods only, but the document has a service line with it. For a service choose the code of its place of supply (e.g. HO: supplied in a third country, EUFAD37: reverse charge in another member state).
