# Invoice types and díjbekérő
NavOnlineErrReplacementType = A replacement invoice cannot be sent to NAV with this module. To correct an invoice, issue a credit note for the original invoice, then a new invoice.
NavOnlineErrSituationType = A situation invoice cannot be sent to NAV with this module. Issue deposit invoices and a final invoice instead.
NavOnlineErrProformaEnqueue = Proforma: not an invoice, so it cannot be sent to NAV.
NavOnlineDijbekeroNoInvoice = A díjbekérő (payment request) was made for this order, but there is no validated deposit or standard invoice yet. The díjbekérő is not an invoice and is not reported to NAV: if the customer has paid, a deposit invoice has to be issued for the payment.
