NavOnlineExtraNonVatHelp = Domestic organisation that is not a VAT subject and has no tax number (not a private person). It is reported to NAV as an "other" customer, without tax number. If it has a tax number, enter that instead and leave this unticked.
NavOnlineRateNotFound = No MNB exchange rate found (%s, %s): the rate of the invoice was not changed. Check the rate before the invoice is sent to NAV.
